00:18:10.700 --> 00:18:12.950
What are the benefits of
an integrated video meeting

00:18:12.950 --> 00:18:14.660
tool versus a standalone one?

00:18:14.660 --> 00:18:16.160
Urosh, do you want
to speak to this?

00:18:16.160 --> 00:18:17.868
UROSH PAJIC: Yeah,
it's a great question.

00:18:17.868 --> 00:18:21.020
So, like I said before,
what we focused with Meet

00:18:21.020 --> 00:18:23.210
is supporting the whole
lifecycle of a meeting.

00:18:23.210 --> 00:18:26.000
So how you prepare, how you
engage, how do you follow up,

00:18:26.000 --> 00:18:27.996
how do you make
meetings more effective.

00:18:27.996 --> 00:18:29.870
And that's why the
integration of the G Suite

00:18:29.870 --> 00:18:30.920
are very important.

00:18:30.920 --> 00:18:32.870
Think about note taking,
scheduling meetings,

00:18:32.870 --> 00:18:35.570
finding time, escalating
from Chat to Meet.

00:18:35.570 --> 00:18:38.180
It's very important
that all of these things

00:18:38.180 --> 00:18:40.504
save time on your
day-to-day basis.

00:18:40.504 --> 00:18:42.170
With a standalone
solution, you actually

00:18:42.170 --> 00:18:44.030
have to integrate that
standalone solution

00:18:44.030 --> 00:18:45.934
into your existing ecosystem.

00:18:45.934 --> 00:18:47.100
First of all, that's costly.

00:18:47.100 --> 00:18:50.210
And it's actually never--

00:18:50.210 --> 00:18:52.100
you're never able to do
it to the full extent

00:18:52.100 --> 00:18:53.460
that you actually need it.

00:18:53.460 --> 00:18:55.520
So standalone solution
can be costly,

00:18:55.520 --> 00:18:58.662
or maybe they satisfy a
specific niche use case,

00:18:58.662 --> 00:18:59.870
and that's why you keep them.

00:18:59.870 --> 00:19:01.550
But the integrated
ones definitely

00:19:01.550 --> 00:19:03.756
bring more value to the table.

00:19:03.756 --> 00:19:05.220
TYLER: Cool, thanks.

