00:19:53.594 --> 00:19:56.010
So you can use Hangouts Meet
just on your laptop or phone.

00:19:56.010 --> 00:19:58.384
It's free as a part of G Suite,
and it works pretty well.

00:19:58.384 --> 00:20:00.830
Especially if you're taking
a one-on-one meeting,

00:20:00.830 --> 00:20:01.830
a laptop can work.

00:20:01.830 --> 00:20:03.690
Or on the go in an
airport, your phone

00:20:03.690 --> 00:20:05.430
is a really useful client.

00:20:05.430 --> 00:20:07.710
We found most customers,
especially larger ones,

00:20:07.710 --> 00:20:10.680
really enjoy the dedicated
room hardware just

00:20:10.680 --> 00:20:13.380
