working and ready to go.

00:20:13.380 --> 00:20:17.040
You also do get a little
bit higher quality of audio

00:20:17.040 --> 00:20:21.270
and video-- in the visuals--

00:20:21.270 --> 00:20:22.836
as it's dedicated
for that purpose.

00:20:22.836 --> 00:20:24.210
Whereas your
smartphone or laptop

00:20:24.210 --> 00:20:25.630
is trying to do a lot
of different things.

00:20:25.630 --> 00:20:27.671
So we really encourage it
to help drive adoption,

00:20:27.671 --> 00:20:30.675
and to have the highest
quality meetings possible.

